      {
        "name": "The Sentence Case Rule",
        "body": "No uppercase labels and no eyebrows. Labels are small, sentence case and set in ink-3.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Ambient Only Rule",
        "body": "Every shadow is soft, blurred and offset only on the y axis, with a negative spread. There are no hard offset shadows and no coloured glows on controls.",
